# Side panel captures: layer rows, the collapsed "Add field" list, and
# editing tags in place.
#
# Coordinate model: the viewport center is at window (488, 388) — see
# select.osmscript for the derivation; fixtures/styles.osm is described in
# styles.osmscript. The side panel is the default 280px wide, so it spans
# window x 920..1200.
#   node 2001 cafe          at      (448, 328)
#   way  3005 untagged      through (188, 553)
# Side-panel rows below the preset Fields section move whenever a preset gains
# or loses a field, so for the untagged way the script collapses Fields first
# (header y=210). Tags then has its header at y=243, its "(no tags)" / first
# tag row at y=276 and "Add tag" at y=311 (window coordinates).

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/styles.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s

# A cafe: its twenty optional fields sit behind one "Add field" control, so
# Tags and History stay on screen.
click 448,328
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected node 2001
capture docs/screenshots/side-panel-01-fields.png

# An untagged way. "Add tag" appends a row of key/value inputs.
click 188,553
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 3005
# Collapse Fields (header y=210) so the Tags rows sit at fixed positions
# whatever the preset's fields: Tags header y=243, "Add tag" y=311.
click 1000,210
wait_idle 1s
click 960,311
wait_idle 2s

# Type the key, Enter moves to the value. (The pauses give the app a frame
# to move the text cursor between inputs; scripted keys arrive far faster
# than typed ones.)
key t
key e
key s
key t
key enter
wait 250ms
key y
key e
key s
wait 250ms
capture docs/screenshots/side-panel-02-add-tag.png

# Enter in the value commits the tag.
key enter
wait_idle 2s
capture docs/screenshots/side-panel-03-tag-added.png

# Clicking a value edits it in place.
click 1050,276
wait_idle 2s
capture docs/screenshots/side-panel-04-edit-value.png
key escape
wait_idle 2s

# The eye toggles a layer's visibility without changing the active layer.
click 942,75
wait_idle 2s
capture docs/screenshots/side-panel-05-layer-hidden.png

log done
